Package: porelo-mcp
Version: [[deb.version]]
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Michael Schnell <michael@fuin.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= [[mcp.glibc.floor]]), zlib1g (>= 1:[[mcp.zlib.floor]])
Homepage: https://github.com/porelo-ai/porelo-mcp
Description: Porelo's daemon contract as MCP tools
 Offers every method of the Porelo daemon's Tasks1 interface as an MCP tool:
 over HTTP on a task's own Unix socket when the daemon starts it, and over
 stdio for a person's own MCP client.
